<title>USA: Andrew Corp to open plant in China.</title>
<headline>Andrew Corp to open plant in China.</headline>
<dateline>ORLAND PARK, Ill. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andrew Corp said Monday it plans to open a manufacturing plant in Suzhou, China, which is expected to start production in October 1998.</p>
<p>Andrew said it will start manufacturing in China in August 1997, working from an interim facility in Suzhou.</p>
<p>The new facility will make base station antennas, coaxial cable, connectors and other Andrew products for the wireless telephone market in China. Construction will start on the 50,000 square-foot building in August, 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
